      "description": "A large serif request field in the elevated surface.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-prompt\"><label for=\"ds-trip\">What do you have in mind?</label><textarea id=\"ds-trip\" class=\"ds-request\" placeholder=\"30 miles, 3 days in Colorado…\" rows=\"2\"></textarea></div>",
      "css": ".ds-prompt{padding:24px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--surface-elevated,#272f27);color:var(--cream,#f5f0e6);font-family:var(--font-inter,Inter),Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;}.ds-prompt label{font-size:14px;font-weight:600}.ds-request{display:block;width:100%;min-height:100px;margin-top:7px;padding:16px 0;border:0;border-radius:0;background:transparent;color:var(--cream,#f5f0e6);font-size:26px;line-height:1.35;resize:vertical;font-family:var(--font-playfair,\"Playfair Display\"),\"Playfair Display\",Georgia,serif;}.ds-request::placeholder{color:var(--plan-muted,#adb7a7);opacity:1}.ds-request:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#c8f04a);outline-offset:4px;}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-prompt{padding:20px}.ds-request{font-size:23px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Weight summary",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "weight-panel",
      "description": "The measured pack total and its labeled breakdown; preview values are illustrative.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-weight\"><div><span>Calculated starting pack</span><strong>12.5 <small>lb</small></strong></div><dl><div><dt>Base gear</dt><dd>3.4 lb</dd></div><div><dt>Food, water &amp; fuel</dt><dd>9.1 lb</dd></div><div><dt>Worn separately</dt><dd>0.0 lb</dd></div></dl></div>",
      "css": ".ds-weight{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;padding:22px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--surface,#1e241e);color:var(--cream,#f5f0e6);font-family:var(--font-inter,Inter),Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;}.ds-weight span,.ds-weight dt{font-size:12px;color:var(--plan-muted,#adb7a7)}.ds-weight strong{display:block;font-size:38px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:500;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-weight small{font-size:16px;font-weight:500;color:var(--plan-muted,#adb7a7)}.ds-weight dl{flex:1;max-width:260px;min-width:190px;margin:0;font-size:12px}.ds-weight dl>div{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding:6px 0}.ds-weight dd{margin:0;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}@media(max-width:1050px){.ds-weight{flex-direction:column;gap:12px}.ds-weight dl{max-width:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Planning steps",
      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "Three equal navigation buttons; current step has a lime underline.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-steps\" aria-label=\"Trip planning steps\"><button aria-current=\"step\"><span>1</span>Find a trail</button><button><span>2</span>Prepare your pack</button><button><span>3</span>Pack &amp; go</button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-steps{display:flex;border-bottom:1px solid var(--plan-line,#3d473a)}.ds-steps button{display:flex;flex:1;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;padding:16px 8px;border:0;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;background:transparent;color:var(--plan-muted,#adb7a7);font-size:13px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.3;cursor:pointer;font-family:var(--font-inter,Inter),Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;}.ds-steps button[aria-current]{border-bottom-color:var(--accent,#c8f04a);color:var(--cream,#f5f0e6)}.ds-steps span{color:var(--accent,#c8f04a)}.ds-steps button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#c8f04a);outline-offset:4px;}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-steps button{flex-direction:column;padding:12px 5px;font-size:11px;gap:5px}.ds-steps span{font-size:13px}}"
